                                "sense_id": "8006e6f8-08a4-32b4-a226-d54d6ea4adee",
                                "text": "Then is the man your father killed one of your family? It’s clear he must be, because you wouldn’t be taking out proceedings for homicide on behalf of someone who wasn’t family."
